1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,136
Narrator: Scenario 26. Network and access.

2
00:00:05,736 --> 00:00:15,744
B: My VPN connection shows as active, but the production management page times out. I need to review a deployment before the release meeting.

3
00:00:16,344 --> 00:00:27,120
A: Can you reach other internal services through this connection? Please tell me whether the failure affects one hostname, the entire management subnet, or everything.

4
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:39,480
B: The internal documentation site and code repository work. Two management hosts in the same subnet time out, although both names resolve to expected addresses.

5
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:50,856
A: That narrows the scope. Please share the VPN profile name and failure timestamps through the support ticket, without including credentials or connection secrets.

6
00:00:51,456 --> 00:01:02,112
C: Your approved profile includes read-only access to that management network. I will compare the assigned routes and policy groups with the access approval.

7
00:01:02,712 --> 00:01:12,264
B: I moved to the new VPN client yesterday. Could reinstalling the client help, or should I try adding the missing route manually first?

8
00:01:12,864 --> 00:01:23,616
A: Please leave the client configuration unchanged while we collect evidence. A manual route could hide the provisioning problem and might not match your approved access.

9
00:01:24,216 --> 00:01:34,704
C: The new client received the standard profile instead of the approved operations profile. Its route list does not include the management subnet.

10
00:01:35,304 --> 00:01:46,128
A: Can you correct the profile assignment through the normal access process? We should verify that the update grants only the management destinations already approved.

11
00:01:46,728 --> 00:01:58,152
C: Yes. I will apply the approved mapping and ask you to reconnect. We will check the route table and gateway logs at 13:30 UTC.

12
00:01:58,752 --> 00:02:09,120
B: I will reconnect at that time and test the read-only management page. I will also confirm that the documentation site and repository still work.

13
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:20,136
A: I will document the results and hand the client migration issue to the VPN owner. Successful connection alone will not be our closure criterion.
